:: Craft Exp Gain Display [nobr]
/*
  使用前需设置：
    $CraftGainKey     = 技艺key
    $CraftGainAmount  = 获得的经验数值
    $CraftGainResult  = gainCraftExp返回的_craftGainResult

    使用例:

    玩家获得了30exp炼金经验
    <<set $CraftGainKey = "alchemy">>
    <<set $CraftGainAmount = 30>>
    <<gainCraftExp $Player "alchemy" 30>>
    <<set $CraftGainResult = _craftGainResult>>

    <<include "Craft Exp Gain Display">>

*/
<<if $CraftGainResult>>
  <<set _cegDef = $CraftLibrary[$CraftGainKey]>>
  <<set _cegName = _cegDef ? _cegDef.name : $CraftGainKey>>

  <<= _cegName>>经验 +<<= $CraftGainAmount>>

  <<if $CraftGainResult.levelsGained > 0>>
    <br><strong><<= _cegName>>提升到了 Lv<<getCraftLevel $Player $CraftGainKey>><<= _craftLevel>>！</strong>

    <<if $CraftGainResult.newUnlocks.length > 0>>
      <br>新解锁：
      <<for _cegU = 0; _cegU < $CraftGainResult.newUnlocks.length; _cegU++>>
        <<set _cegUnlock = $CraftGainResult.newUnlocks[_cegU]>>
        <br>　・<<= _cegUnlock.desc>>
      <</for>>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
